[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Spice V2 - Milestone Implementation Plan and Work Packages

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Version 2.0, 2026-11-20. Turns the V2 C++20 + KLU + OSDI + Xyce Strangler Fig + StarLark-cs + Schematic architecture into concrete, gate-based vertical slices. v2/backlog.json is derived from this document.

Work packages progress honestly from Proposed -> InProgress -> Verified only when their exit gates execute and pass. Dependencies form an acyclic graph.
<<<

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1. Slice 0 and M1 platform foundation (XyceBackend + DSL + Schematic)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: PLAN-V2-001
STATUS: InProgress
TITLE: Slice 0 - Branch reset, adjusted StrictDoc set and C++20 build scaffold
STATEMENT: >>>
Establish branch v2, the six authoritative StrictDoc documents, lean AGENTS.md, derived backlog.json, CMake/vcpkg C++20 core scaffold (core types, universal DAE Device contract, versioned spice_capi.h), passing unit/boundary tests, and .NET V2 solution layout.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Phase: Slice 0
Depends-on: none
Deliverables: v2/AGENTS.md, 6 StrictDoc files under v2/docs/requirements/, v2/backlog.json, v2/CMakeLists.txt, v2/vcpkg.json, v2/include/spice/capi.h, v2/cpp/{core,dae,capi}, v2/tests/, v2/dotnet/ solution skeleton.
Verification: Clean C++20 CMake build with warnings-as-errors, passing unit/ABI/DAE tests, real gcov line/branch coverage on owned C++20 code, and StrictDoc UID/parent validation.
<<<
