[REQUIREMENT]
UID: PLAN-V2-002
STATUS: InProgress
TITLE: M1a - Canonical IR, Unified Device Descriptor and thin XyceBackend
STATEMENT: >>>
Implement the immutable Canonical IR, fail-closed Unified Device Descriptor registry, typed ResultManifest schema, and thin external-process XyceBackend (GPL-isolated) in Spice.Ir and Spice.Sdk, plus opt-in independent DC/AC/transient physical audits.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Phase: M1
Depends-on: PLAN-V2-001
Deliverables: Spice.Ir (CanonicalIr, DeviceRegistry, SpiceNetlistEmitter), Spice.Sdk (ISimulationBackend, GPL-isolated XyceBackend with CSV parser, DifferentialComparer, NativeCppBackend), Spice.Tests/M1PlatformTests.cs.
Verification: .NET 11.0.100 Release build (TreatWarningsAsErrors=true) passes 5/5 xUnit tests in Spice.Tests with 0 warnings, including mocked XyceBackend deck/CSV/differential verification and live in-process NativeCppBackend OP/AC/TRAN over libspice_capi.so. Remaining: live external Xyce executable differential run on Windows host.
<<<
