[REQUIREMENT]
UID: PLAN-V2-006
STATUS: InProgress
TITLE: M2b - Nonlinear DAE solver, autodiff B-sources and generic OSDI 0.3/0.4 loader
STATEMENT: >>>
Implement dimensioned Newton with voltage limiting and source/Gmin continuation (mandatory final Gmin removal), adaptive BE/Trapezoidal/BDF2 integration with breakpoints, compiled B-source expression VM with dual-number autodiff, and one generic OSDI 0.3/0.4 dynamic loader running OpenVAF-compiled Diode, VBIC/BJT, BSIM3, BSIM4, JFET, and EKV models, plus the native canonical SPICE3f5 parser/elaborator.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Phase: M2
Depends-on: PLAN-V2-005
Deliverables: cpp/solver (dimensioned Newton + step limiting + Gmin/source continuation with mandatory gmin=0 final solve), cpp/analysis (variable-step BDF2 + adaptive Milne LTE step control with rollback & breakpoint landing), cpp/devices (Shockley+charge Diode, MutualInductance K, compiled autodiff expr_vm B_v/B_i), cpp/osdi (generic OSDI 0.3/0.4 dlopen/LoadLibrary loader + OsdiDevice), cpp/parser (native SPICE3f5 parser & hierarchical .SUBCKT/.PARAM/.MODEL/.OSDI elaborator), cpp/cli (spice_v2_cli with version/check/run, JSON/CSV export, deterministic exit codes), tests/m2b_{nonlinear_osdi,parser_lte_cli}_tests.cpp.
Verification: GCC 12 and Clang 14 -O3 -Werror builds pass all 4 CTest binaries (18 tests) in 0.06 s, covering nonlinear diode/B-source/OSDI 0.3 dlopen, variable-step BDF2 2nd-order convergence, adaptive LTE step growth & breakpoint landing, hierarchical SPICE3f5 decks (incl. .OSDI), and spice_v2_cli exit codes/outputs. Remaining to close M2b: OpenVAF-compiled BSIM3/BSIM4/VBIC/JFET/EKV .osdi differential qualification against Xyce/ngspice.
<<<
