[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 3. M3 RF steady-state and M4 mixed-signal / ecosystem

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: PLAN-V2-008
STATUS: InProgress
TITLE: M3 - RF steady-state and periodic analyses over universal DAE
STATEMENT: >>>
Implement .DISTO (Volterra), .HB (Harmonic Balance), .ENVELOPE, .PSS (driven/autonomous shooting), .PAC, .PXF, .PNOISE (Floquet/PPV phase noise), .PSTB, and quasi-periodic .QPSS/.QPAC/.QPXF/.QPNOISE reusing the universal DAE and OSDI model interfaces.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Phase: M3
Depends-on: PLAN-V2-007
Deliverables: cpp/analysis/rf_steady_state.{hpp,cpp} (.HB spectral collocation + exact Fourier-Newton Jacobian, driven .PSS shooting + analytical monodromy tangent propagation, .PAC periodic AC sideband conversion matrix, .PXF adjoint conversion transfer matrix, .PNOISE cyclostationary thermal + Parseval shot-noise folding, and autonomous oscillator .PSS solving unknown period T + phase anchor), tests/m3_rf_steady_state_tests.cpp (5 test suites).
Verification: GCC 12 and Clang 14 -O3 -Werror builds verify .HB linear AC phasors (<1e-11), nonlinear diode .HB vs .PSS harmonic parity (<2 mV), slow-RC (tau=20T) peak detector shooting, real dlopen OSDI 0.3 diode in .HB/.PSS, .PAC/.PXF complex reciprocity (<1e-11), .PNOISE stationary reduction to .NOISE (<1e-11) + pumped cyclostationary noise folding, and autonomous Van der Pol LC oscillator limit-cycle locking within 1% of ideal tank resonance. Remaining to close M3: .PSTB, .DISTO, .ENVELOPE, Floquet/PPV phase noise, quasi-periodic .QPSS, and Xyce HB differential checks.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ARCH-CAP-002

